WEBVTT

00:00:27.065 --> 00:00:30.359
was born 15 minutes earlier,
so I can vote.

00:00:30.943 --> 00:00:33.654
It’s arbitrary and unfair!

00:00:33.946 --> 00:00:36.240
The voting age should be lowered to 16!

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:38.701
I firmly disagree!

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.872
No way 16-year-olds are mature enough to 
make decisions with national consequences.

00:00:42.872 --> 00:00:45.666
I’m eligible and I don’t even know
who’s running.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:49.420
Meanwhile, I know the candidates
inside and out.

00:00:50.046 --> 00:00:52.090
She's obsessed with politics.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.593
Exactly! If 16-year-olds aren’t mature
enough to vote,

00:00:55.593 --> 00:00:58.805
then by that same logic, 
they shouldn’t be allowed to drive.

00:00:58.846 --> 00:01:01.849
I firmly disagree! 
I’m an excellent driver!